{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporal Branches is a 2D Platformer all about Time! Switch between the Past, Present and Future to alter levels, changing everything from enemies and level elements, to even the bosses you'll face! Can you find out the mystery of the corrupted branches?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between Past, Present &amp; Future as you traverse levels and experience each timeline's unique elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more characters as you hunt down the source of the corruption, each with their own unique moves and way to play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover alternate timelines to explore as you progress through the game, serving as additional challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Bonus Levels available to those who clear the main story.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552320?t=1759616755","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552320/4d62d2cf186ddc5d73394f8fd83b314c1893e045/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759616755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552320/6c3953628825788e0f927403b7fb5313c50fc12f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759616755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552320/6c3953628825788e0f927403b7fb5313c50fc12f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759616755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":